gram; di lomba memakai LOGO! 230RCE."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"LOGO! Soft Comfort","a":"Software untuk memprogram LOGO!."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"FBD","a":"Function block diagram: cara memprogram dengan blok."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"On-delay / off-delay","a":"Timer tunda menyala / tunda mati."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Stairway (lampu tangga)","a":"Timer yang menyala sekian waktu lalu mati sendiri."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Counter","a":"Penghitung jumlah pulsa."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Web server / IP","a":"Fitur LOGO! untuk diakses lewat jaringan; alamat IP harus diatur."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Backup micro SD","a":"Menyimpan program LOGO! di kartu micro SD."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"KNX","a":"Standar otomasi gedung dengan kabel bus."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"ETS","a":"Software untuk memprogram perangkat KNX."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"PSU 640 mA","a":"Catu daya bus KNX."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Physical address","a":"Alamat unik setiap perangkat KNX."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Group address (GA)","a":"Alamat fungsi yang menghubungkan tombol dengan aktuator."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Aktuator","a":"Perangkat KNX penggerak beban: switching, dimmer, shutter."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Binary input","a":"Perangkat KNX yang membaca kontak biasa."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Push button 4 gang","a":"Tombol KNX dengan 4 tombol."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Group monitor","a":"Fitur ETS untuk melihat telegram dan mencari error."},{"g":"D. Kendali, smart relay, dan KNX","t":"Scene / central","a":"Satu perintah untuk banyak fungsi sekaligus (misalnya \"semua lampu mati\")."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"K3","a":"Keselamatan dan kesehatan kerja."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"PPE","a":"Personal protective equipment: kacamata, sepatu, sarung tangan, ear plug."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Dead / live","a":"Tanpa tegangan / bertegangan. Semua pekerjaan harus dalam keadaan dead."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"LOTO","a":"Lock out tag out: gembok dan label agar sumber tidak dinyalakan orang lain."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Energisasi","a":"Memberi tegangan ke rangkaian; hanya setelah diizinkan pembina/juri."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Inspeksi visual","a":"Pemeriksaan mata sebelum pengukuran."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Zeroing","a":"Me-nol-kan alat ukur tahanan rendah sebelum mengukur."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Continuity","a":"Uji sambungan tidak putus, termasuk penghantar PE."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"IR (insulation resistance)","a":"Tahanan isolasi, diuji 500 V DC; minimal 1 MΩ."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Pembumian","a":"Tahanan penghantar proteksi; maksimal 0,5 Ω."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Polarity","a":"Fasa dan netral terpasang di tempat yang benar."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Urutan fasa","a":"L1–L2–L3 searah jarum jam pada socket 3 fasa."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Test sheet","a":"Lembar hasil pengujian; tidak boleh ada kolom kosong."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"MCB","a":"Pemutus arus mini untuk proteksi beban lebih dan hubung singkat."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"ELCB / RCD","a":"Pemutus arus bocor tanah."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Fault finding","a":"Mencari kerusakan pada rangkaian."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Fault rig","a":"Papan latihan berisi kerusakan yang sengaja dipasang."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Half-split","a":"Cara mencari fault dengan membagi rangkaian menjadi dua bagian berulang-ulang."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Open circuit","a":"Rangkaian putus."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Short circuit","a":"Hubung singkat."},{"g":"E. Pengujian, fault finding, dan K3","t":"Maintenance","a":"Perawatan atau penggantian komponen tanpa merusak instalasi lain."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"TIS","a":"Training Information System: aplikasi pemantau latihan."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Musim","a":"Satu periode program (misalnya LKS EI 2026–2027)."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Admin / Juri / Pengamat","a":"Peran pengguna: semua menu / mengisi nilai, jurnal, log / hanya melihat."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Beranda","a":"Halaman awal: jadwal hari ini, kuis angka teknis, TO berikutnya."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Jadwal · Tuntas","a":"Daftar latihan harian; dicentang bila target hari itu tercapai."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Assessment","a":"Tempat mengisi nilai TO per aspek, catatan juri, dan foto."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Results","a":"Grafik dan tabel hasil semua TO serta indeks seleksi."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Gate Test","a":"Daftar syarat G1–G7 yang dicentang saat terbukti."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Reports","a":"Lembar cetak: laporan hasil TO, Mark Summary, Marking Form."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Jurnal","a":"Catatan angka latihan per siswa per drill."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Log Harian","a":"Laporan kegiatan harian asisten."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"Aktivitas otomatis","a":"Catatan otomatis siapa mengisi apa dan jam berapa."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"MARKS OPEN / LOCKED","a":"Nilai TO masih bisa diubah / sudah dikunci admin."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"COMPLETE / PARTIAL","a":"Semua aspek TO sudah dinilai / belum semua."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"✓ / ✗","a":"Tersimpan / gagal tersimpan (cek internet, isi ulang)."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi TIS","t":"OFFLINE","a":"Internet terputus."},{"g":"F. Aplikasi 